# Windows flutter test launch (design/299)

Bare `flutter test` dies when `ProgramFiles(x86)` is unset (`0x2371`).

- Run `scripts/flutter_test.cmd` (optionally with flutter args).
- Do not assign `$env:ProgramFiles(x86)` or `$env:'ProgramFiles(x86)'`. PowerShell treats that as a drive.
- Do not insert a new test into an existing test function. Append it, then run the file.
